  "html": "<figure><img alt=\"\" height=\"700\" src=\"/legacy/img/bdacaac67d-mczh-tw1920x700-large3611-250146249752.jpg\" width=\"1014\"></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" height=\"700\" src=\"/legacy/img/c4869d3838-mczh-tw1920x700-large3612-171737549753.jpg\" width=\"1025\"></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" height=\"700\" src=\"/legacy/img/4495139772-mczh-tw1920x700-large3613-522294649753.jpg\" width=\"1026\"></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" height=\"700\" src=\"/legacy/img/c77d207d87-mczh-tw1920x700-large3614-17378849753.jpg\" width=\"1046\"></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" height=\"700\" src=\"/legacy/img/319cd832ea-mczh-tw1920x700-large3615-673126949753.jpg\" width=\"1019\"></figure>\n<p><strong>EMRD來到台積電參訪囉!🤩🤩</strong><br> 上週三10/21，由施劭儒執行長帶領108級學長們，前往『護國神山』台積電位於台中的廠務學院進行參訪。<br> 實地走訪一圈，學長們提問踴躍，收穫滿滿滿!!<br> 感謝機械系郭俊良教授鼎力相助，促成此次參訪良緣。</p>",
